WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.350
Boss!

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.310
Could I get this week's energy potions?

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.020
Sure. I've got your usual here.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:08.880
Here you go.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.450
Thanks, boss.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.660
I'll be back next week. See you then.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.390
Okay.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.280
Boss, you've got a customer.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.000
Are you Mr. Reiji?

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.440
Yes, that's me.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.330
Woof?

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:37.310
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:37.310
<b>In Another World</b>

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:01.160
My name is Rayne.

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:03.620
<b>Rayne</b>

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:06.350
I am the butler serving 
Lord Casty Fen Dran Valgas.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.400
Okay...

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:11.500
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 1
Beautiful Belle's
Beautiful Skin Gel</b>

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.880
Cas-en-tra?

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.890
Ms. Noela, let's be quiet for now.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:13.520
Woof...

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:17.650
I have been instructed to invite 
you to the manor by Lady Flam,

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.490
the wife of the head of the Valgas family.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.230
Huh?

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:27.210
M-Mr. Reiji, I had no idea you'd 
become so close with another woman.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:31.710
Not only that, but she's someone's wife, 
meaning... she's a m-married woman!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.880
Master, what's a married woman?

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.650
Don't worry about it, Noela.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:38.860
And Mina, don't let your 
imagination run away with you!

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.840
U-Uh... I'm sorry, but who are you?

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.010
You don't know, boss?

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:49.890
Count Casty Fen Dran Valgas is the lord 
who rules over Kalta and our village.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:50.390
Indeed.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.940
You mean he's like a noble?

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.150
Exactly.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.110
What does someone like that want with me?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:01.570
Lady Flam said she would tell you 
about that when you met in person.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:06.830
Mr. Reiji, you need to settle things with 
her before it turns into a serious matter!

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:07.370
Huh?!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.580
This way, please.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.700
A carriage?!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:10.430
So fast!

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:11.370
So huge!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:15.340
<b>Lady Flam</b>

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:15.340
You're the genius alchemist 
everyone's talking about?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:20.300
Uh... I'm not one of those, 
but I'm probably who they meant.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.280
What can I do for you?

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.010
Your butler said you'd tell me face to face.

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:29.080
Allow me to be direct.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.930
I'd like you to prepare an 
ointment of rejuvenation.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.050
An ointment of rejuvenation?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.230
You can do it, can't you?

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:38.890
Y-Yes. How long do I have to develop it?

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:39.620
Five days.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:40.280
Five days?!

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.550
No, since the dinner party 
is five days from now,

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.870
could you bring it here by 
afternoon five days from now?

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.010
Five days isn't enough time.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.190
Oh, dear! Are you saying I'll have 
to endure the lords gossiping

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:56.000
about how old I look behind my back again?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:01.920
They're wrong, Lady Flam. 
You're young and beautiful.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.010
A-Am I?

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:08.430
Yes. You're plenty beautiful 
just the way you are.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:15.650
It's no use, though. Even if 
you believe that, they don't.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:20.840
<i>I see. Once someone spreads malicious gossip 
about her, she loses her confidence.</i>

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.860
<i>That used to happen to me all 
the time in the other world.</i>

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:28.600
Alchemist, please. 
Isn't there anything you can do?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.080
I'll pay as much as you want.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:35.670
Oh, no. I ask only that you pay me fairly 
once I've completed your ointment.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.960
You mean you'll make it?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.620
Uh...

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.070
<i>What have I done?</i>

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.390
Very well. I'll do what I can.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.050
Even if I can't actually restore your youth,

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.430
I can create a medicine that 
will make you look younger.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:54.850
Oh, I see! You're going to 
fight the effects of aging!

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.560
It won't be anything that miraculous!

00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:01.080
Truly you are a genius alchemist, 
to defy the providence of God!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.280
<b>4 Days Later</b>

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:07.990
There.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.780
I've got all the ingredients.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:15.410
It looks like Mr. Reiji was asked to make 
some kind of medicine as compensation.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.480
Compensation?

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.290
Oh, I'm sorry. Noela-san, you 
don't need to know that word.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.500
Woof?

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.820
There, it's done.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:50.990
<b>Beautiful Belle's
 Beautiful Skin Gel</b>

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.860
<i>Beautiful Belle's Beautiful Skin Gel.</i>

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.470
<i>Moisturizes and beautifies the skin.</i>

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.910
<i>Prevents moisture from escaping 
and makes the skin supple.</i>

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.910
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.910
I've come to deliver your medicine.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:56.120
This is it?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.830
Yes. Please put it on your 
face every day after bathing.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.050
On my face?

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:06.260
Alchemist, you're not trying 
to trick me, are you?

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:10.420
Then pretend you've fallen for 
my trick and try using it.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.680
If it doesn't work, you don't need to pay me.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.480
It smells lovely.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.620
It contains flowers and fruit.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.800
Test it out on the back of your hand.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.730
My, it's practically being absorbed into my skin!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.200
But I'm a bit reluctant to put it on my face.

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:40.860
It's not me who has to suffer frustration 
and sadness at the dinner party, but you.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.840
If you don't want to use it, then that's fine.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:49.080
If you're so insistent, then I shall try it.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:54.390
I'm sick of being the 
subject of their mockery.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:58.310
That's right. Get back at 
the people who mocked you.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.280
Indeed.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.350
I'm excited for the dinner party already.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:17.060
Mr. Reiji, have you taken care of that matter?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:18.290
What matter?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:22.620
You and that noblewoman... You know...

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.000
Your a-affair, Mr. Reiji.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.710
You haven't been to her manor recently, so...

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.510
<i>What? She still thinks that's what happened?</i>

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.470
Woof. Someone's here.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.270
Woof. Master, they gave me this.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.850
Gave you what?

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:44.060
Wow, these cookies look expensive.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:48.990
<i>Because of you, alchemist, I was 
able to get back at those lords.</i>

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:49.950
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.520
Oh, good. It worked out.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:54.070
What a relief.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.340
Delicious, delicious!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.710
Such noble flavors.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:02.120
<i>It looks like people are still confused,</i>

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:06.380
<i>but if they're satisfied, then I'm satisfied.</i>

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.040
Such beautiful skin.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:20.080
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 2
Charm Fragrance</b>

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.100
Master!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.220
Master, Drills is here.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.280
Drills?

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:24.330
Yes. Ms. Ringlets is looking 
for you, Mr. Reiji.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.730
Ringlets?

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.140
How do you do?

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.820
I am Elaine Fen Dran Valgas.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.820
<b>Elaine</b>

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.350
I feel like I've heard that name recently.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:37.500
Reiji-san, it's that noble family.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.050
Oh, right.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:44.060
Mr. Reiji, you still haven't settled 
the matter with that woman yet?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.070
Woof.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.540
And now you've gotten her daughter involved?

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.590
I told you, it's not like that!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:48.590
Woof.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.830
Shouldn't you take a more 
respectful attitude?

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:58.250
I came all the way to this remote place 
by myself to bless you with my presence.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.740
Bless us with your presence?

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.010
Nobody asked you to come!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.690
Okay, Ms. Noela. You're coming with me.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.610
Listen, miss,

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:11.330
if you want respect, you should start 
by respecting the people around you.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.320
That's the first step toward becoming an adult.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.820
D-Don't treat me like a child!

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:16.690
Huh?

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:20.600
The day after tomorrow, I will be 
attending a dinner party with my father.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:22.710
I am a proper lady!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.290
I... I see.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.640
So, did you come here to buy something?

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.140
Have you saved up enough allowance?

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.130
Or did your mother ask you to buy something?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.770
I'm not here on an errand for my mother.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:39.680
I came here today to request 
that you make a medicine for me.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.180
Request what?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:47.440
My mother was unrecognizably 
rejuvenated by the medicine you made.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:51.720
So naturally, you should be able 
to make something for me, as well.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:54.300
That depends on the time frame 
and nature of the medicine.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.780
By the day after tomorrow, 
I'd like a love potion to—

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.890
No way. I can't do that for you.

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:03.530
Why not? Are you saying you can fulfill 
my mother's request, but not mine?

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:05.200
Listen, you—

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.370
It's Elaine!

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.980
Uh... Listen, Elaine—

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.790
That's Ms. Elaine to you!

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:17.340
Ms. Elaine, you don't need 
a love potion to be cute.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.210
You're already an attractive lady.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:20.970
I know that.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.850
<i>She's not denying it.</i>

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:31.660
But Lord Lards of the Gallardo family 
will be attending the dinner party.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.780
And I, um...

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.990
I see. So that's why you want a love potion?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.630
Yes. B-But it's not what you think.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:44.740
Lord Lards is the second son of a count.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.180
Our families are on equal footing.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:56.050
So, well... As far as I'm concerned,
I could get a far better man.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:11:00.760
I see. You are an attractive lady, after all.

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.400
You're making fun of me, aren't you?

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:04.590
You noticed?

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.220
Have the decency to deny it!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:08.580
Sorry.

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:12.030
Hey, you should take people 
seriously when they're talking!

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:14.290
She seems to be enjoying herself.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:15.880
Woof?

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:23.660
Okay, listen. Suppose you use a love potion 
and Lord Lards falls in love with you.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.490
Okay.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:30.130
Here. This was from your mother, actually.

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.420
Woof.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:31.830
Ms. Noela!

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:33.380
Woof...

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:39.480
Anyway, suppose he falls in 
love with you. Then what?

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:45.060
Unless you keep taking the love potion, 
he won't stay in love with you.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.870
Isn't there something else you could be 
working on instead of getting a love potion?

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:55.060
Then what should I do to attract Lord Lards?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:56.160
Huh?

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:00.870
<i>I don't have any experience with this...</i>

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.620
<i>But I have to tell her something.</i>

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:10.020
Uh, well, let me see... I know! Yeah!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.690
I can't make you a love potion,

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:16.290
but I might be able to make you a 
medicine that will make you attractive.

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:18.880
Really? You can?

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.610
Y-Yeah.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:21.850
Woof.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:28.170
<i>I may not have romantic skills, but in 
this world, I have medicine-making skills!</i>

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:33.460
Oh, how marvelous! You can 
move your ears and tail!

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.810
This is my first time seeing a beastling.

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.710
I'm not a beastling!

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.440
What could you be other than a beastling?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.240
I'm a werewolf!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.240
Is there a difference?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.770
A big difference!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.200
<i>Oh, come on...</i>

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:50.620
Master, I don't like Drills!

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.290
You've got the dignity of a werewolf.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.840
Ms. Noela, what about me?

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.810
I like you!

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:00.300
Hooray!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.240
<i>All right. Now for the finishing touches.</i>

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.490
Done!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:19.230
<b>Charm 
Fragrance</b>

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:16.170
<i>Charm Fragrance.</i>

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:19.230
<i>A perfume with a refreshing fruit smell.</i>

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.190
Smells good.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.840
D-Did you finish your love potion?

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:30.460
Just so you know, it's not a love potion.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:31.660
Here are the effects.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:36.580
What? "An ordinary perfume that smells nice"?

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.850
Yes. It may be an ordinary perfume,

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:42.050
but if you use it according to my 
instructions, you'll level up as a lady.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.860
I'll level up?

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:49.000
However, it's possible to 
ruin its effects with your

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.180
attitude, expression, and behavior.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:53.890
I-I know that.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:58.250
<i>This side of her is compliant and cute.</i>

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.380
Now rub your wrists together.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:06.770
Okay. Like this?

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:08.770
My, what a lovely smell.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:11.470
But this doesn't seem like enough.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.830
Applying too much actually 
makes it unpleasant.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:17.580
I see. You're quite 
well-informed, aren't you?

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.750
You just know too little.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.750
S-Surely there's a kinder way to phrase that.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:28.060
I'm the daughter of the Valgas 
family that rules over this town.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.520
I know. Okay, now we'll do your neck.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:36.210
I see reminding you of my 
status has no effect on you.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.430
What an odd person.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.390
That should do it.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.830
Drills has a nicer look on her face now.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.060
What a lovely smell!

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:46.860
Fragrances can change hearts.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.610
Impressive work, Mr. Reiji.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.990
Welco—

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:54.090
I heard milady is— She's here!

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.240
Miss, I've been looking for you!

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.560
Oh, my. You found me.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.020
What? You didn't tell your 
butler you were coming here?

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:06.800
Mr. Reiji, thank you for this. Take care.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.850
Good luck at the dinner party.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.380
Where did that c-come from?!

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:17.100
I-I don't need your encouragement! 
I'm a lady overflowing with charm!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.890
Y-You don't need to worry about me!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:23.590
<i>She's probably at the age where 
she's in love with being in love.</i>

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.340
<i>I'm sure plenty of things will go wrong,</i>

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.740
<i>but I hope that perfume 
helps her in some small way.</i>

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:31.260
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:34.280
<b>Several Days Later</b>

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.760
<i>At least, that's what I thought.</i>

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:37.140
How do you do?

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:40.220
Welco— Oh, Elaine.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:42.460
What's the matter? 
Isn't the dinner party today?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:46.350
Actually, I've decided not to go.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.100
Huh?

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.380
Wh-When I thought about it,

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:56.820
I realized a man who speaks frankly 
w-would be a better match for me.

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:57.890
Uh-huh...

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:03.560
A-And besides, I prefer talented men.

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:07.520
Oh, Ms. Elaine. What brings you here today?

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:14.860
I-I've come to help around the shop.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:15.980
Help?

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:16.530
Woof?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.070
I don't know what you could do to help.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:24.190
I-I'm sure I could do anything 
that beastling can do.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:26.920
I'm not a beastling! I'm a werewolf!

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:29.380
Huh? Are you wearing that perfume?

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:34.090
Yes. I, um... wore it today.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.220
Do you find it unpleasant?

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.980
No, it smells good.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.930
But why did you wear it?

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:44.010
B-Because I'm a lady.

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:46.810
And I'll be here for two days.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:47.900
Two days?

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:52.110
I got permission to work 
here from my parents.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.570
And from my butler, as well.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.910
You never got my permission.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.070
Woof. Master is right.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:02.260
Even my father said 
I could work for two days.

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:05.150
He said it would be a good opportunity 
to learn about the world.

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:08.040
Don't you need my permission 
first as the owner of this shop?

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.300
Woof. Master is right.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.800
Mr. Reiji, will you not allow it?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.020
Master, no Drills.

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:18.030
Why don't we do this?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.100
You can assist Ms. Noela.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.400
That sounds like a good idea.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.260
Woof! I'll teach Drills!

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:29.130
You're going to teach me, Ms. Noela?

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.740
Not Ms. Noela. Professor Noela!

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:34.150
Professor Noela. How marvelous.

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:41.040
Actually... I would prefer 
to have Mr. Reiji teach me.

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.160
Master is busy. He doesn't have time for you.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.210
Good luck, you two.

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:54.000
Woof. You have to listen to me.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:54.810
Okay.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.980
First, greetings. Welcome!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:58.010
Welcome!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.010
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.220
Woof. Are you listening, Drills?

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.170
Hey.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:03.840
Welcome.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:05.430
Welcome to our store.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:09.160
Well, what are you looking for today?

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:12.570
I graciously offer you my assistance.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:17.340
Boss, what's going on here?

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.400
Sorry.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.910
I'm really sorry.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:24.180
Don't worry. It's funny, so it's all good.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.370
See you later.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:28.800
We're lucky Ms. Micott was our customer.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:29.950
Elaine.

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:35.090
If you interact with customers like that, 
they'll stop coming. They think it's creepy.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.670
Okay, Lady Elaine?

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:42.550
Huh? C-Could you say that one more time?

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:46.040
I said, if you interact 
with customers like that—

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:49.240
Not that. The "Lady Elaine" part.

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:52.480
Lady... Elaine?

00:18:54.060 --> 00:19:01.850
Oh, I can imagine slipping out of my 
manor at night to secretly meet with you!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:05.310
But you and I are a 
noblewoman and a commoner.

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:06.960
Our statuses are too different!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.910
<i>I'm not sure what this is, 
so I'm going to ignore it.</i>

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:15.380
<i>And so, Lady Elaine and her ringlets 
worked at the shop for two days.</i>

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.850
Ms. Noela, here you go.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:19.960
For me?

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:23.240
Yes. I made this perfume myself.

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:25.390
Mr. Reiji taught me how to make it.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:31.620
Thanks, Drills. You can have this.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.930
Oh, my. It looks just like your tail.

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:36.110
A substitute Noela.

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:41.070
Ms. Noela, would it be 
all right if I came again?

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.030
Sure.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.000
Thank you, Ms. Noela.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:52.030
They've become friends.

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:53.660
I never expected this.

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:59.670
It's so hot.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:01.130
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 3
Sweetheart Cooling Gel</b>

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:02.970
Why is it so hot today?

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:06.380
I'm going to squeeze you.

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:08.970
Get off of me, you hairball!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:11.590
It's hot up by the ceiling, too.

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:12.810
How do you do?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.520
I have arrived.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.550
Drills!

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:19.920
I'm sorry. I didn't come to 
play with you today, Ms. Noela.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:23.420
Since it's so hot, my father 
instructed me to ask Mr. Reiji

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:26.030
to make a medicine that 
will bring winter to us.

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.120
I can't do that!

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.230
You can't?

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:32.000
Look, magic and medicine aren't the same...

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:36.640
Actually, that might work. All right.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:43.970
<b>Sweetheart
 Cooling Gel</b>

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:38.380
Done.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.090
<i>Sweetheart Cooling Gel.</i>

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:43.970
<i>As the gel evaporates, it removes heat.</i>

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:45.730
First, I'll test it on myself.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.460
I'm experiencing an extremely 
localized winter!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:53.860
Cold, cold!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.860
It's that cold? I want to try it, too!

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:54.930
Me, too!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.660
Me, too!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.980
Cold, cold, cold!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.530
Winter has arrived! 
Winter, in the middle of summer!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.630
You're right. Mr. Reiji's 
medicines never fail to impress.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:09.200
S-So cold...

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:12.350
So sleepy...

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.360
Ms. Noela, don't go to sleep!

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.640
I'm so cold... and sleepy...

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:24.340
I love you, Mr. Reiji...

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.840
Are you freezing to death in the mountains?!

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.870
You used all of it?!

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:32.310
If you use too much, you'll get too cold!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.980
<b>Closing Time</b>

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:35.440
Kirio Drugstore.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:36.600
Thank you...

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.560
...for visiting...

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.950
...again today.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:42.400
Woof.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:51.980
Incredible. This is incredible.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:04.960
<b>Next Customer</b>

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.020
So this is the Rabbit Tavern.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by:</b>
